    {
      "name": "1. Setup - User Login (Pre-seeded Users)",
      "description": "START HERE!\n\n**DEFAULT USERS (auto-created by seeder):**\n1. Super Admin: admin@tspark.com / SuperAdmin123!\n2. Gym Owner: gymowner@tspark.com / GymOwner123!\n3. Client 1: client1@tspark.com / Client123!\n4. Client 2: client2@tspark.com / Client123!\n\n**Just run `docker-compose up` and all users are ready!**\n\n**Roles:**\n- `super_admin`: Full platform access\n- `gym_owner`: Can create/manage gyms and challenges\n- `client`: Can join gyms, participate in challenges, log workouts, add friends",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1.1 Login Super Admin",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('superAdminToken', jsonData.data.token);",
                  "    console.log('Super Admin token saved!');",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@tspark.com\",\n  \"password\": \"SuperAdmin123!\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Login as Super Admin (auto-created by seeder).\n\nCredentials:\n- Email: admin@tspark.com\n- Password: SuperAdmin123!\n\n**Auto-saves token** to `{{superAdminToken}}`"
