    {
      "name": "7. Users (Admin)",
      "description": "User management endpoints for administrators.\n\n**IMPORTANT**: To create users with elevated roles (gym_owner, super_admin), use the Admin Create User endpoint.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "7.1 Admin Create User (Super Admin)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    console.log('User created:', jsonData.data.user.email, 'with role:', jsonData.data.user.role);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{superAdminToken}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/users/admin/create",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["users", "admin", "create"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"newgymowner@tspark.com\",\n  \"password\": \"GymOwner123!\",\n  \"firstName\": \"New\",\n  \"lastName\": \"GymOwner\",\n  \"role\": \"gym_owner\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "**Requires Super Admin token!**\n\nCreate a user with any role. This is the ONLY way to create users with elevated roles.\n\n**Available roles:**\n- `client` - Regular user\n- `gym_owner` - Can create gyms and challenges\n- `super_admin` - Full platform access"
          },
          "response": []
        },
